     "<div dir=\"ltr\">各位前進，您好：<p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-j-Y484mq4XA/W0d0DpVlRnI/AAAAAAAAJaE/8gLTmtNcYjgAeH0Th5UlclfJO2hWseJgACLcBGAs/s1600/%25E6%259C%25AA%25E5%2591%25BD%25E5%2590%258D.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-j-Y484mq4XA/W0d0DpVlRnI/AAAAAAAAJaE/8gLTmtNcYjgAeH0Th5UlclfJO2hWseJgACLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E6%25259C%2525AA%2525E5%252591%2525BD%2525E5%252590%25258D.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237442275000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0TtU7Nlbukoi_nej0QlRci\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-j-Y484mq4XA/W0d0DpVlRnI/AAAAAAAAJaE/8gLTmtNcYjgAeH0Th5UlclfJO2hWseJgACLcBGAs/s320/%25E6%259C%25AA%25E5%2591%25BD%25E5%2590%258D.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"179\"></a></p><div>如圖，第一欄為作答題數，</div><div>我想將超過作答題數的部份設定為na，</div><div>如：第一人：n=3，我希望得到的資料框為1 1 2 na na na .....</div><div>我該如何寫指令呢?</div><div>謝謝先進的教導</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lS1VpzeaBwAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
