    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ocean,<div><br></div><div>本應用使用 for 迴圈逐行處理即可, 使用 c( ) 函數將2個部分合併:</div><div><br></div><div><div>1.合法資料: 第1行至作答行資料取出, <font color=\"#ff0000\">mydf[i, 1:(mydf$n[i]+1)]</font></div><div><br></div><div>2.填滿 na: <font color=\"#ff0000\">rep(&quot;na&quot;, ncol(mydf)-(1+mydf$n[i]))</font></div></div><div><br></div><div>應用函數:</div><div><ul><li>for () { } : for 迴圈</li><li>c: 向量合併</li><li>nrow: 資料列數, 本例為20</li><li>rep(xxx, 重覆次數): 重覆 xxx 資料, 第2個參數為重覆次數</li><li>ncol: 資料行數, 本例為21</li><li>mydf$n[i]: 取出mydf 資料中, 欄位名稱為n的行資料, [i]: 第i列</li></ul></div><div>R程式:</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div>set.seed(123)</div><div>mydf &lt;- data.frame(matrix(c(sample(20, 20, replace = TRUE), sample(4, 400, replace = TRUE)), ncol=21))</div><div>names(mydf) &lt;- c(&quot;n&quot;, paste0(&quot;v&quot;, 1:20))</div><div>mydf</div><div><br></div><div>for (i in 1:nrow(mydf)) {</div><div>  mydf[i,] &lt;- c(mydf[i, 1:(mydf$n[i]+1)], rep(&quot;na&quot;, ncol(mydf)-(1+mydf$n[i])))</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>mydf</div></font></div></code></div><div><br></div>執行畫面:</div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5nuQvtSG360/W087xSX2KQI/AAAAAAAASg0/X95rkr8c2GYYkTN6QMBjAa11lSnSM0WNwCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E9%2583%25A8%25E4%25BB%25BD%25E8%25A8%258A%25E6%2581%25AF%25E4%25BB%25A5na%25E5%258F%2596%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E4%25B9%258B.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5nuQvtSG360/W087xSX2KQI/AAAAAAAASg0/X95rkr8c2GYYkTN6QMBjAa11lSnSM0WNwCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E9%252583%2525A8%2525E4%2525BB%2525BD%2525E8%2525A8%25258A%2525E6%252581%2525AF%2525E4%2525BB%2525A5na%2525E5%25258F%252596%2525E4%2525BB%2525A3%2525E4%2525B9%25258B.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237442277000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0f56T_dij2djcsYobqNY3w\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-5nuQvtSG360/W087xSX2KQI/AAAAAAAASg0/X95rkr8c2GYYkTN6QMBjAa11lSnSM0WNwCLcBGAs/s400/%25E9%2583%25A8%25E4%25BB%25BD%25E8%25A8%258A%25E6%2581%25AF%25E4%25BB%25A5na%25E5%258F%2596%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E4%25B9%258B.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"393\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"># end</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div>ocean於 2018年7月12日星期四 UTC+8下午11時32分12秒寫道：</div></div>"
